OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be another very
OL,6,Funsettled day with severe
OL,7,Fsouthwesterly gales, perhaps storm
OL,8,Fforce at first in the northwest,
OL,9,Fslowly moderating later. Frequent
OL,10,Fheavy showers, prolonged in the
OL,11,Fnorthwest at first, some sunny
OL,12,Fintervals between the showers later.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FFurther blustery showers this
OL,15,Fevening and tonight, along with a few
OL,16,Fclear intervals. Strong southwesterly
OL,17,Fwinds, with gales at first in the
OL,18,Fnorth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
