OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FBright or sunny intervals
OL,6,Fand further showers, most frequent in
OL,7,Fwest but becoming more scattered in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon as winds continue to
OL,9,Fease down.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FThursday will be mainly dry, though
OL,13,Fmainly cloudy with a few light
OL,14,Fshowers. Some sunshine around too. A
OL,15,Fdry start Friday then rain spreading
OL,16,Ffrom west. Rain easing later Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
